Cell["\<\
The fix-only rule (185a327) uses a subset of these clauses (it never splits \
under negation except through not), so the same argument covers it. 0.1.0 \
fails exactly at its bail clause.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e136f7cf-cb43-4dfe-bff4-354052f68bce"],

