every shape up to the bound, and for all sizes by R2\"\>"},
    {"\<\"atoms \[NotEqual] requirement\"\>", "\<\"0\"\>", "\<\"9,951 guards \
\[RightArrow] 0 [R3]\"\>", "\<\"no precondition is lost either: the atoms are \
exactly the requirement\"\>"},
    {"\<\"atoms per guard\"\>", "\<\"more atoms = finer blame\"\>", \
"\<\"73,671 (fix) \[RightArrow] 101,022 (+ De Morgan) [R3]\"\>", "\<\"the De \
Morgan commit only refines; it never adds an unsound atom\"\>"},
    {"\<\"imprecise atoms\"\>", "\<\"draft: 1.8 %, \\\"mostly where a leaf \
repeats\\\"\"\>", "\<\"1.5 %; 0 when no leaf repeats [R4]\"\>", "\<\"the \
remaining gap is semantic (cross-atom), not syntactic\"\>"},
    {"\<\"reproduction blockers\"\>", "\<\"only the fuel guard\"\>", \
"\<\"0.1.0: !p, !r; both fixes: !r [R5]\"\>", "\<\"the reported symptom is \
gone\"\>"},
    {"\<\"control-flow shapes\"\>", "\<\"atoms necessary\"\>", "\<\"3 of 5 \
shapes unsound [R6]\"\>", "\<\"a second root cause, outside expression \
splitting\"\>"}
   },
