Cell["\<\
The counts from files (11 and 17 bundled actions, 408, 865 and 1,072 in the \
corpus, recognition 330 and 5,808, the 13/11 and 53/27 bounds) are \
measurements, made with the Python scripts in scripts/ next to this notebook.\
\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"e8a46782-b6a4-4b93-8122-cf7769c14a7f"],

Cell["\<\
The model is two-valued logic over the guard leaves. Python's truthiness \
agrees with it; a leaf that raises lands in unevaluated, which \
explain_dead_end never names as a blocker.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"01748520-2963-4039-82d7-0c6d0700fa57"],

Cell["\<\
Diagnostics run after find_plan returns; none of this changes which plans are \
found.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"18a91762-eaa5-438b-a541-84217ecb5c1e"],

