Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Appendix: definitions (initialization cells)", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2de96ff7-cbca-4d44-85f8-2c67430a45a4"],

Cell["\<\
Inert syntax and[..], or[..], not[..] over leaves p, q, r, so that Wolfram \
does not simplify an expression before the rules see it. The notebook has its \
own context (CellContext -> Notebook), so a p, q or r defined elsewhere \
cannot leak into the leaves. nnf, cons and old mirror \
guards._requirement_atoms at 3948b54, at 185a327, and 0.1.0.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"85dc1937-4106-4fb3-92d8-3d2d15aa6ee3"],

